# Wan-AI/Wan2.2-TI2V-5B-Diffusers: the UMT5 encoder is already BF16.
# The transformer and VAE source tensors are FP32. Retain FP32 timestep
# projections for Wan's modulation path and cast the remaining weights to BF16.
#
# rad-convert <pinned Wan Diffusers directory> --recipe \
#     data/recipes/wan-2.2-ti2v-5b-bf16.recipe -o wan-2.2-ti2v-5b-bf16.rad
transformer.condition_embedder.time_* cast dtype=f32
transformer.* cast dtype=bf16
vae.*         cast dtype=bf16
